#. Content of the 'about' (HTML) field in DocType 'Product Bundle'
#: erpnext/selling/doctype/product_bundle/product_bundle.json:66
msgid ""
"<h3>About Product Bundle</h3>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Aggregate group of <b>Items</b> into another <b>Item</b>. This is useful "
"if you are bundling a certain <b>Items</b> into a package and you maintain "
"stock of the packed <b>Items</b> and not the aggregate <b>Item</b>.</p>\n"
"<p>The package <b>Item</b> will have <code>Is Stock Item</code> as <b>No</b> "
"and <code>Is Sales Item</code> as <b>Yes</b>.</p>\n"
"<h4>Example:</h4>\n"
"<p>If you are selling Laptops and Backpacks separately and have a special "
"price if the customer buys both, then the Laptop + Backpack will be a new "
"Product Bundle Item.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h3>Apie produktų paketą</h3>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Sujungti <b>prekių</b> grupę į kitą <b>prekę</b>. Tai naudinga, jei tam "
"tikrus <b>Priemonės</b> sujungiate į paketą ir turite supakuotų "
"<b>Priemonių</b> atsargų, o ne agreguotos <b>Priemonės</b> atsargų.</"
"p>³<p>Paketas <b>Priemonė</b> turės <kodas>Ar tai atsargų prekė</kodas> kaip "
"<b>Ne</b> ir <kodas>Ar tai pardavimo prekė</kodas> kaip <b>Taip</b>.</p>\n"
"<h4>Pavyzdys:</h4>\n"
"<p>Jei parduodate nešiojamuosius kompiuterius ir kuprines atskirai ir "
"taikote specialią kainą, jei klientas perka abu, tada nešiojamasis "
"kompiuteris + kuprinė bus naujas Prekės paketo elementas.</p>"

#. Content of the 'Help' (HTML) field in DocType 'Currency Exchange Settings'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/currency_exchange_settings/currency_exchange_settings.json:51
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<h3>Currency Exchange Settings Help</h3>\n"
"<p>There are 3 variables that could be used within the endpoint, result key "
"and in values of the parameter.</p>\n"
"<p>Exchange rate between {from_currency} and {to_currency} on "
"{transaction_date} is fetched by the API.</p>\n"
"<p>Example: If your endpoint is exchange.com/2021-08-01, then, you will have "
"to input exchange.com/{transaction_date}</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h3>Valiutos keitimo nustatymų pagalba</h3>\n"
"<p>Turime 3 kintamuosius, kurie gali būti naudojami galiniame taške, "
"rezultato rakte ir parametro reikšmėse.</p>\n"
"<p>Valiutos keitimo kursas tarp {from_currency} ir {to_currency} "
"{transaction_date} gaunamas per API.</p>\n"
"<p>Pavyzdys: Jei jūsų galinis taškas yra exchange.com/2021-08-01, turėsite "
"įvesti exchange.com/{transaction_date}</p>"

#. Content of the 'Body and Closing Text Help' (HTML) field in DocType 'Dunning
#. Letter Text'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/dunning_letter_text/dunning_letter_text.json:56
#, python-format, python-brace-format
#, fuzzy
msgid "<h4>Body Text and Closing Text Example</h4>\n\n<div>We have noticed that the following payments, totaling {{ currency }} {{ total_outstanding }}, are overdue:</div>\n<ul>\n{% for row in overdue_payments %}\n<li>Invoice {{ row.sales_invoice }}: {{ currency }} {{ row.outstanding }}, due on {{ row.due_date }}.</li>\n{% endfor %}\n</ul>\n<div>Please pay the amount due immediately to avoid any further dunning cost.</div>\n\n<h4>How to get fieldnames</h4>\n\n<p>The fieldnames you can use in your template are the fields in the document. You can find out the fields of any documents via Setup &gt; Customize Form View and selecting Dunning or Overdue Payment for the payment rows</p>\n\n<h4>Templating</h4>\n\n<p>Templates are compiled using the Jinja Templating Language. To learn more about Jinja, <a class=\"strong\" href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/dev/templates/\">read this documentation.</a></p>"
msgstr "<h4>Pagrindinio teksto ir baigiamojo teksto pavyzdys</h4>\n\n<div>Pastebėjome, kad šie mokėjimai, kurių bendra suma sudaro {{ currency }} {{ total_outstanding }}, yra pradelsti:</div>\n<ul>\n{% for row in overdue_payments %}\n<li>Sąskaita {{ row.sales_invoice }}: {{ currency }} {{ row.outstanding }}, mokėjimo terminas {{ row.due_date }}.</li>\n{% endfor %}\n</ul>\n<div>Prašome nedelsiant sumokėti skolą, kad išvengtumėte papildomų išieškojimo išlaidų.</div>\n\n<h4>Kaip gauti laukų pavadinimus</h4>\n\n<p>Laukų pavadinimai, kuriuos galite naudoti savo šablone, yra dokumente esantys laukai. Bet kurio dokumento laukus galite rasti meniu „Setup“ > „Customize Form View“ ir pasirinkę „Dunning“ arba „Overdue Payment“ mokėjimo eilutėms</p>\n\n<h4>Šablonai</h4>\n\n<p>Šablonai sudaromi naudojant „Jinja“ šablonų kalbą. Norėdami sužinoti daugiau apie „Jinja“, <a class=\"strong\" href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/dev/templates/\">perskaitykite šią dokumentaciją.</a></p>"

#. Content of the 'Contract Template Help' (HTML) field in DocType 'Contract
#. Template'
#: erpnext/crm/doctype/contract_template/contract_template.json:55
msgid ""
"<h4>Contract Template Example</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<pre>Contract for Customer {{ party_name }}\n"
"\n"
"-Valid From : {{ start_date }} \n"
"-Valid To : {{ end_date }}\n"
"</pre>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>How to get fieldnames</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>The field names you can use in your Contract Template are the fields in "
"the Contract for which you are creating the template. You can find out the "
"fields of any documents via Setup &gt; Customize Form View and selecting the "
"document type (e.g. Contract)</p>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>Templating</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Templates are compiled using the Jinja Templating Language. To learn more "
"about Jinja, <a class=\"strong\" href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/dev/"
"templates/\">read this documentation.</a></p>"
msgstr ""
"<h4>Sutarties šablono pavyzdys</h4>\n"
