#. Description of the 'Update Stock' (Check) field in DocType 'Purchase
#. Invoice'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/purchase_invoice/purchase_invoice.json:619
msgid ""
"If checked, updates inventory; stock and accounting entries are created "
"together. Leave unchecked if a Purchase Receipt is created separately."
msgstr ""
"Jei pažymėta, atnaujinamas atsargų sąrašas; atsargų ir apskaitos įrašai "
"sukuriami kartu. Palikite nepažymėtą, jei pirkimo kvitas sudaromas atskirai."

#. Description of the 'Service Address' (Small Text) field in DocType 'Warranty
#. Claim'
#: erpnext/support/doctype/warranty_claim/warranty_claim.json:322
msgid "If different than customer address"
msgstr "Jei skiriasi nuo kliento adreso"

#. Description of the 'Disable In Words' (Check) field in DocType 'Global
#. Defaults'
#: erpnext/setup/doctype/global_defaults/global_defaults.json:73
msgid "If disable, 'In Words' field will not be visible in any transaction"
msgstr "Jei išjungta, laukas „Žodžiais“ nebus matomas jokioje operacijoje"

#. Description of the 'Disable Rounded Total' (Check) field in DocType 'Global
#. Defaults'
#: erpnext/setup/doctype/global_defaults/global_defaults.json:65
msgid ""
"If disable, 'Rounded Total' field will not be visible in any transaction"
msgstr ""
"Jei išjungta, laukas „Suapvalinta suma“ nebus matomas jokiame sandoryje"

#. Description of the 'Ignore Pricing Rule' (Check) field in DocType 'Pick
#. List'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/pick_list/pick_list.json:219
msgid ""
"If enabled then system won't apply the pricing rule on the delivery note "
"which will be create from the pick list"
msgstr ""
"Jei įjungta, sistema netaikys kainodaros taisyklės važtaraščiui, kuris bus "
"sukurtas iš surinkimo sąrašo."

#. Description of the 'Pick Manually' (Check) field in DocType 'Pick List'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/pick_list/pick_list.json:212
msgid ""
"If enabled then system won't override the picked qty / batches / serial "
"numbers / warehouse."
msgstr ""
"Jei įjungta, sistema neperašys pasirinkto kiekio / partijų / serijos "
"numerių / sandėlio."

#. Description of the 'Send Document Print' (Check) field in DocType 'Request
#. for Quotation'
#: erpnext/buying/doctype/request_for_quotation/request_for_quotation.json:307
msgid "If enabled, a print of this document will be attached to each email"
msgstr ""
"Jei ši funkcija įjungta, šio dokumento kopija bus pridedama prie kiekvieno "
"el. laiško"

#. Description of the 'Auto Repost Incorrect Valuation Entries (Weekly)'
#. (Check) field in DocType 'Stock Reposting Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_reposting_settings/stock_reposting_settings.json:127
msgid ""
"If enabled, a weekly scheduler scans the Stock Ledger Variance for item-"
"warehouses with incorrect valuation in the current financial year and auto-"
"creates Item & Warehouse based reposts to fix them."
msgstr ""
"Jei ši funkcija įjungta, savaitinis planavimo įrankis peržiūri atsargų "
"knygos nuokrypius ir nustato prekių bei sandėlių, kurių vertinimas "
"einamaisiais finansiniais metais yra neteisingas, bei automatiškai sukuria "
"perrašymus pagal prekes ir sandėlius, kad juos ištaisytų."

#. Description of the 'Enable discount accounting for selling' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Selling Settings'
#: erpnext/selling/doctype/selling_settings/selling_settings.json:216
msgid ""
"If enabled, additional ledger entries will be made for discounts in a "
"separate Discount Account"
msgstr ""
"Jei ši funkcija įjungta, bus daromi papildomi buhalteriniai įrašai dėl "
"nuolaidų atskiroje nuolaidų kor.sąskaitoje"

#. Description of the 'Send Attached Files' (Check) field in DocType 'Request
#. for Quotation'
#: erpnext/buying/doctype/request_for_quotation/request_for_quotation.json:300
msgid ""
"If enabled, all files attached to this document will be attached to each "
"email"
msgstr ""
"Jei įjungta, visi prie šio dokumento pridėti failai bus pridedami prie "
"kiekvieno el. laiško"

#. Description of the 'Do not update Serial / Batch on creation of auto bundle'
#. (Check) field in DocType 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json:421
msgid ""
"If enabled, do not update serial / batch values in the stock transactions on "
"creation of auto Serial \n"
" / Batch Bundle. "
msgstr ""
"Jei įjungta, neatnaujinti serijos / partijos verčių atsargų operacijose, kai "
"sukuriamas automatinis serijos \n"
" / partijos paketas. "

#. Description of the 'Consider Projected Qty in Calculation' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Production Plan'
#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/production_plan/production_plan.json:421
msgid ""
"If enabled, formula for <b>Qty to Order</b>: <br>\n"
"Required Qty (BOM) - <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/"
"projected-quantity\">Projected Qty</a>. <br> This helps avoid over-ordering."
msgstr ""
"Jei įjungta, formulė <b>Qty to Order</b>: <br>\n"
"Reikalaujamas kiekis (GS) - <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/"
"manual/en/projected-quantity\">Prognozuojamas kiekis</a>. <br>Tai padeda "
"išvengti per didelio užsakymo."

#. Description of the 'Consider Projected Qty in Calculation (RM)' (Check)
#. field in DocType 'Production Plan'
#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/production_plan/production_plan.json:239
msgid ""
"If enabled, formula for <b>Required Qty</b>: <br>\n"
"Required Qty (BOM) - <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/"
"projected-quantity\">Projected Qty</a>. <br> This helps avoid over-ordering."
msgstr ""
"Jei įjungta, formulė <b>Required Qty</b>: <br>\n"
"Reikalaujamas kiekis (GS) - <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/"
"manual/en/projected-quantity\">Prognozuojamas kiekis</a>. <br>Tai padeda "
"išvengti per didelio užsakymo."

#. Description of the 'Create Ledger Entries for Change Amount' (Check) field
#. in DocType 'POS Settings'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pos_settings/pos_settings.json:46
msgid ""
"If enabled, ledger entries will be posted for change amount in POS "
"transactions"
msgstr ""
"Jei įjungta, buhalteriniai įrašai bus daromi kasos operacijų grąžos sumai"

#. Description of the 'Automatically run rules on unreconciled transactions'
#. (Check) field in DocType 'Accounts Settings'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/accounts_settings/accounts_settings.json:747
msgid "If enabled, rule matching algorithm will run every hour"
msgstr ""
"Jei ši funkcija įjungta, taisyklių atitikimo algoritmas bus vykdomas kas "
"valandą"

#. Description of the 'Grant Commission' (Check) field in DocType 'Item'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/item/item.json:919
msgid ""
"If enabled, sales from this item will be included in Sales Person and Sales "
"Partner commission calculations"
msgstr ""
"Jei ši funkcija įjungta, šio prekės vieneto pardavimai bus įtraukti į "
"pardavėjo ir pardavimo partnerio komisinių skaičiavimus"

#. Description of the 'Allow delivery of overproduced quantity' (Check) field
#. in DocType 'Selling Settings'
#: erpnext/selling/doctype/selling_settings/selling_settings.json:279
msgid ""
"If enabled, system will allow user to deliver the entire quantity of the "
"finished goods produced against the Subcontracting Inward Order. If "
"disabled, system will allow delivery of only the ordered quantity."
msgstr ""
"Jei ši funkcija įjungta, sistema leis naudotojui pristatyti visą gatavos "
"produkcijos kiekį, pagamintą pagal subrangos priėmimo užsakymą. Jei "
"išjungta, sistema leis pristatyti tik užsakytą kiekį."

#. Description of the 'Set incoming rate as zero for expired Batch' (Check)
#. field in DocType 'Selling Settings'
#: erpnext/selling/doctype/selling_settings/selling_settings.json:318
msgid ""
"If enabled, system will set incoming rate as zero for stand-alone credit "
"notes with expired batch item."
msgstr ""
"Jei ši funkcija įjungta, sistema nustatys įeinančio tarifo vertę kaip nulį "
"atskiriems kredito įrašams su pasibaigusiu partijos elementu."

#. Description of the 'Deliver secondary Items' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Selling Settings'
#: erpnext/selling/doctype/selling_settings/selling_settings.json:344
msgid ""
"If enabled, the Secondary Items generated against a Finished Good will also "
"be added in the Stock Entry when delivering that Finished Good."
msgstr ""
"Jei ši funkcija įjungta, pristatant gatavą produktą, į atsargų įrašą taip "
"pat bus įtraukti pagal tą gatavą produktą sugeneruoti antriniai elementai."

#. Description of the 'Disable Rounded Total' (Check) field in DocType 'POS
#. Profile'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pos_profile/pos_profile.json:397
msgid "If enabled, the consolidated invoices will have rounded total disabled"
msgstr ""
"Jei ši funkcija įjungta, konsoliduotose sąskaitose faktūrose suapvalinta "
"suma bus išjungta"

#. Description of the 'Allow internal transfers at user-defined rate' (Check)
#. field in DocType 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json:428
msgid ""
"If enabled, the item rate won't adjust to the valuation rate during internal "
"transfers, but accounting will still use the valuation rate. This will allow "
"the user to specify a different rate for printing or taxation purposes."
msgstr ""
"Jei ši funkcija įjungta, atliekant vidinius pervedimus prekės kaina nebus "
"priderinama prie vertinimo kurso, tačiau apskaitoje vis tiek bus naudojamas "
"vertinimo kursas. Tai leis vartotojui nurodyti kitokį kursą spausdinimo ar "
"apmokestinimo tikslais."

#. Description of the 'Validate Material Transfer warehouses' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json:502
msgid ""
"If enabled, the source and target warehouse in the Material Transfer Stock "
"Entry must be different else an error will be thrown. If inventory "
"dimensions are present, same source and target warehouse can be allowed but "
"atleast any one of the inventory dimension fields must be different."
msgstr ""
"Jei įjungta, medžiagų perkėlimo atsargų įraše turi būti nurodytas skirtingas "
"išdavimo ir paskirties sandėlis, priešingu atveju bus išmesta klaida. Jei "
"yra atsargų matmenys, galima leisti naudoti tą patį išdavimo ir paskirties "
"sandėlį, tačiau bent vienas iš atsargų matmenų laukų turi būti skirtingas."

#. Description of the 'Allow negative stock for Batch' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json:509
msgid ""
"If enabled, the system will allow negative stock entries for the batch. But, "
"this may lead to incorrect valuation rates, so it is recommended to avoid "
"using this option. The system will permit negative stock only when it is "
"caused by backdated entries and will validate and block negative stock in "
"all other cases."
msgstr ""
"Jei ši parinktis įjungta, sistema leis įvesti neigiamus partijos atsargų "
"kiekius. Tačiau tai gali lemti neteisingus vertinimo koeficientus, todėl "
"rekomenduojama šios parinkties nenaudoti. Sistema leis įvesti neigiamus "
"atsargų kiekius tik tuomet, kai tai susiję su atgaline data įvestais "
"įrašais; visais kitais atvejais ji patikrins įvestis ir užblokuos neigiamus "
"atsargų kiekius."

#. Description of the 'Allow Negative Stock for Batch' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Batch'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/batch/batch.json:210
msgid ""
"If enabled, the system will allow negative stock entries for this batch, "
"overriding the 'Allow negative stock for Batch' setting in Stock Settings. "
"This may lead to incorrect valuation rates, so it is recommended to avoid "
"using this option."
msgstr ""
"Jei ši parinktis įjungta, sistema leis įvesti neigiamus atsargų kiekius šiai "
"partijai, nepaisydama nustatymo „Leisti neigiamas atsargas partijai“, "
"esančio skyriuje „Atsargų nustatymai“. Tai gali lemti neteisingus vertinimo "
"koeficientus, todėl rekomenduojama šios parinkties nenaudoti."

#. Description of the 'Allow UOM with conversion rate defined in Item' (Check)
#. field in DocType 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json:475
msgid ""
"If enabled, the system will allow selecting UOMs in sales and purchase "
"transactions only if the conversion rate is set in the item master."
msgstr ""
"Jei ši funkcija įjungta, sistema leis pasirinkti MV pardavimo ir pirkimo "
"operacijose tik tuo atveju, jei prekės pagrindiniame elemente nustatytas "
"konvertavimo kursas."

#. Description of the 'Allow Editing of Items and Quantities in Work Order'
#. (Check) field in DocType 'Manufacturing Settings'
#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/manufacturing_settings/manufacturing_settings.json:231
msgid ""
"If enabled, the system will allow users to edit the raw materials and their "
"quantities in the Work Order. The system will not reset the quantities as "
"per the BOM, if the user has changed them."
msgstr ""
"Jei ši funkcija įjungta, sistema leis naudotojams redaguoti žaliavas ir jų "
"kiekius darbo užsakyme. Jei naudotojas pakeitė kiekius, sistema iš naujo "
"nenustatys jų kiekio, kaip nurodyta GS."

#. Description of the 'Set valuation rate for rejected Materials' (Check) field
#. in DocType 'Buying Settings'
#: erpnext/buying/doctype/buying_settings/buying_settings.json:250
#, fuzzy
msgid "If enabled, the system will generate an accounting entry for material rejected anywhere in the purchase cycle."
msgstr "Jei ši funkcija įjungta, sistema sukurs apskaitos įrašą dėl medžiagos, kuri buvo atmesta bet kuriame pirkimo ciklo etape."

#. Description of the 'Enable Item-wise Inventory Account' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Company'
#: erpnext/setup/doctype/company/company.json:994
msgid ""
"If enabled, the system will use the inventory account set in the Item Master "
"or Item Group or Brand. Otherwise, it will use the inventory account set in "
"the Warehouse."
msgstr ""
"Jei ši funkcija įjungta, sistema naudos inventoriaus kor. sąskaitą, "
"nustatytą prekės kortelėje, prekių grupėje arba prekės ženkle. Priešingu "
"atveju bus naudojama sandėlyje nustatyta atsargų sąskaita."

#. Description of the 'Do not use Batch-wise Valuation' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json:435
msgid ""
"If enabled, the system will use the moving average valuation method to "
"calculate the valuation rate for the batched items and will not consider the "
"individual batch-wise incoming rate."
msgstr ""
"Jei įjungta, sistema naudos slankų vidurkio (Moving Average) apskaitos "
"metodą, kad apskaičiuotų vertės tarifą partijoms, ir nebus atsižvelgiama į "
"atskirų partijų įsigijimo kainą."

#. Description of the 'Validate Applied Rule' (Check) field in DocType 'Pricing
#. Rule'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pricing_rule/pricing_rule.json:528
msgid ""
"If enabled, then system will only validate the pricing rule and not apply "
"automatically. User has to manually set the discount percentage / margin / "
"free items to validate the pricing rule"
msgstr ""
"Jei įjungta, sistema tik patvirtins kainodaros taisyklę, bet netaikys jos "
"automatiškai. Vartotojas turi rankiniu būdu nustatyti nuolaidos procentą / "
"maržą / nemokamas prekes, kad būtų patvirtinta kainodaros taisyklė"

#. Description of the 'Include in Charts' (Check) field in DocType 'Financial
#. Report Row'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/financial_report_row/financial_report_row.json:131
msgid "If enabled, this row's values will be displayed on financial charts"
msgstr "Jei įjungta, šios eilutės reikšmės bus rodomos finansinėse diagramose"

#. Description of the 'Confirm before resetting posting date' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Accounts Settings'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/accounts_settings/accounts_settings.json:587
msgid ""
"If enabled, user will be alerted before resetting posting date to current "
"date in relevant transactions"
msgstr ""
"Jei įjungta, naudotojas bus įspėtas prieš atstatant paskelbimo/įtraukimo "
"datą į dabartinę datą atitinkamose operacijose"

#. Description of the 'Disable Serial No and Batch selector' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json:243
msgid ""
"If enabled, users must enter Serial No. / Batch data manually instead of "
"using the selector dialog."
msgstr ""
"Jei ši funkcija įjungta, vartotojai turi rankiniu būdu įvesti serijos "
"numerį / partijos duomenis, o ne naudotis pasirinkimo dialogo langu."

#. Description of the 'Variant Of' (Link) field in DocType 'Item'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/item/item.json:171
msgid ""
"If item is a variant of another item then description, image, pricing, taxes "
"etc will be set from the template unless explicitly specified"
msgstr ""
"Jei prekė yra kitos prekės variantas, tuomet aprašymas, vaizdas, kaina, "
"mokesčiai ir t. t. bus nustatyti iš šablono, nebent aiškiai nurodyta"

#. Description of the 'Get Items for Purchase / Transfer' (Button) field in
#. DocType 'Production Plan'
#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/production_plan/production_plan.json:408
msgid "If items in stock, proceed with Material Transfer or Purchase."
msgstr "Jei prekės yra sandėlyje, atlikite medžiagų perkėlimą arba pirkimą."

#. Description of the 'Role allowed to create/edit back-dated transactions'
#. (Link) field in DocType 'Stock Settings'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json:226
msgid ""
"If mentioned, the system will allow only the users with this Role to create "
"or modify any stock transaction earlier than the latest stock transaction "
"for a specific item and warehouse. If set as blank, it allows all users to "
"create/edit back-dated transactions."
msgstr ""
"Jei paminėta, sistema leis tik šį vaidmenį turintiems naudotojams sukurti ar "
"keisti bet kokią ankstesnę nei paskutinė konkretaus elemento ir sandėlio "
"atsargų operaciją. Jei nustatyta kaip tuščia, visiems naudotojams leidžiama "
"kurti / redaguoti ankstesnės datos operacijas."

#. Description of the 'To Package No.' (Int) field in DocType 'Packing Slip'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/packing_slip/packing_slip.json:90
msgid "If more than one package of the same type (for print)"
msgstr "Jei yra daugiau nei viena to paties tipo pakuotė (spausdinti)"

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pricing_rule/pricing_rule.js:103
msgid ""
"If multiple Pricing Rules continue to prevail, users are asked to set "
"Priority manually to resolve conflict."
msgstr ""
"Jei ir toliau galioja kelios kainodaros taisyklės, naudotojų prašoma "
"nustatyti prioritetą rankiniu būdu, kad būtų išspręstas konfliktas."

#. Description of the 'Use prices from Default Price List as fallback' (Check)
#. field in DocType 'Selling Settings'
#: erpnext/selling/doctype/selling_settings/selling_settings.json:305
msgid ""
"If no Item Price is found for an item in the Price List set in the "
"transaction, prices from the Default Price List will be fetched."
msgstr ""
"Jei sandoryje nurodytame kainoraštyje nerandama prekės kainos, bus paimtos "
"kainos iš numatytojo kainoraščio."

#. Description of the 'Automatically add taxes from Taxes and Charges Template'
#. (Check) field in DocType 'Accounts Settings'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/accounts_settings/accounts_settings.json:611
msgid ""
"If no taxes are set, and Taxes and Charges Template is selected, the system "
"will automatically apply the taxes from the chosen template."
msgstr ""
"Jei mokesčiai nenustatyti ir pasirinktas Mokesčių ir rinkliavų šablonas, "
"sistema automatiškai pritaikys mokesčius iš pasirinkto šablono."

#: erpnext/stock/stock_ledger.py:2686
msgid "If not, you can Cancel / Submit this entry"
msgstr "Jei ne, galite atšaukti / pateikti šį įrašą"

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/opening_invoice_creation_tool/opening_invoice_creation_tool.js:214
msgid "If party does not exist, create it using the Customer Name field."
msgstr "Jei šio partnerio nėra, sukurkite ją naudodami lauką „Kliento vardas“."

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/opening_invoice_creation_tool/opening_invoice_creation_tool.js:215
msgid "If party does not exist, create it using the Supplier Name field."
msgstr ""
"Jei partneris neegzistuoja, ją reikia sukurti naudodamiesi laukeliu „Tiekėjo "
"pavadinimas“."

#. Description of the 'Free Item Rate' (Currency) field in DocType 'Pricing
#. Rule'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pricing_rule/pricing_rule.json:483
msgid "If rate is zero then item will be treated as \"Free Item\""
msgstr ""
"Jei tarifas lygus nuliui, tada prekė bus traktuojama kaip „Nemokama prekė“"

#: banking/src/components/features/BankReconciliation/Rules/RuleForm.tsx:259
msgid "If rule matches, then:"
msgstr "Jei taisyklė atitinka, tuomet:"

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pricing_rule/pricing_rule.js:51
msgid ""
"If selected Pricing Rule is made for 'Rate', it will overwrite Price List. "
"Pricing Rule rate is the final rate, so no further discount should be "
"applied. Hence, in transactions like Sales Order, Purchase Order etc, it "
"will be fetched in 'Rate' field, rather than 'Price List Rate' field."
msgstr ""
"Jei pasirinkta kainodaros taisyklė \"Įkainis\", ji perrašys Kainoraštį. "
"Kainodaros taisyklės tarifas yra galutinis tarifas, todėl jokių papildomų "
"nuolaidų neturėtų būti taikoma. Todėl tokiose operacijose kaip Pardavimo "
"užsakymas, Pirkimo užsakymas ir t. t. ji bus suvedama į lauką \"Tarifas\", o "
"ne į lauką \"Kainoraščio tarifas\"."

#. Description of the 'Default Accounts' (Table) field in DocType 'Customer'
#: erpnext/selling/doctype/customer/customer.json:414
msgid ""
"If set, accounting entries for this customer will post to these accounts "
"instead of the company default."
msgstr ""
"Jei šis parametras nustatytas, šio kliento apskaitos įrašai bus įrašomi į "
"šias sąskaitas, o ne į įmonės numatytąsias."

#. Description of the 'Fixed Outgoing Email Account' (Link) field in DocType
#. 'Buying Settings'
#: erpnext/buying/doctype/buying_settings/buying_settings.json:261
msgid ""
"If set, the system does not use the user's Email or the standard outgoing "
"Email account for sending request for quotations."
msgstr ""
"Jei nustatyta, sistema nenaudoja naudotojo el. pašto arba standartinės "
"išeinančio el. pašto paskyros komercinio pasiūlymo užklausoms siųsti."

#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/work_order/work_order.js:1407
msgid ""
"If the BOM results in Scrap material, the Scrap Warehouse needs to be "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"Jei pagal komplektavimo specifikaciją gaunama laužo medžiaga, reikia "
"pasirinkti laužo sandėlį."

#. Description of the 'Frozen' (Select) field in DocType 'Account'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/account/account.json:148
msgid "If the account is frozen, entries are allowed to restricted users."
msgstr ""
"Jei paskyra įšaldyta, įrašai leidžiami tik riboto naudojimo naudotojams."

#: erpnext/stock/stock_ledger.py:2680
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"If the item is transacting as a Zero Valuation Rate item in this entry, "
"please enable 'Allow Zero Valuation Rate' in the {0} Item table."
msgstr ""
